      <title>Wukong Plays in the Sand</title>
      <link>https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/books/wukong-plays-in-the-sand/</link>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Wukong and his friends try dry sand, then add too much water. They adjust the mix and build a sand tower together. At the end, Wukong finds a little mountain in his shoe.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/covers/wukong-plays-in-the-sand-v2.jpg"&gt;&lt;img src="https://phg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/covers/wukong-plays-in-the-sand-v2.jpg" alt="Wukong Plays in the Sand" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
